  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.6.1 (2.x line, Android on the legacy Google Mobile Ads SDK):\n- Fixed: hidden banners (IsVisible = false) load only once visible, as AdMob's rules require.\n- Fixed (iOS): a banner shown after being hidden no longer fails with \"Invalid ad width or height.\" (code 0).\n- Debug mode says when ads wait for InitialiseConsent() because SkipConsent is on.\nThe banner fallback of 3.1 is 3.x only. Full notes: https://github.com/marcojak/MauiMTAdmob/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
